### ============================================
GET {{analyticsUrl}}/path?days=7


### ============================================
### 22. ADMIN — PATH STATS for nonexistent path
### Expected: total=0, today=0, all zeros in timeseries
### ============================================
GET {{analyticsUrl}}/path?path=%2Fnonexistent&days=7


